  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C.",
    "Heat olive oil in a Dutch oven over medium-high and brown the lardons until crisp, then remove and set aside.",
    "Season the beef cubes with salt and pepper.",
    "In the same pot, sear the beef cubes until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion becomes translucent.",
    "Stir in carrots and potatoes and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Pour in canned tomatoes and beef broth, add appleton rum, and stir to combine.",
    "Return the lardons to the pot, bring to a simmer, cover, and bake in the preheated oven for 105 minutes.",
    "After baking, taste and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve hot."
